    // or selected definitions and their direct imports in batch mode, plus
    // synthetic declarations (three in the first object, two in later ones).
    // The three counts are different things and they have three names.
    // [7] is the number of functions THIS OBJECT DEFINES, which is the batch's
    // own count and is zero in the other modes.
